OL,3,AWhat's gone wrong at Nike? How the
OL,4,Aworld's sportswear giant lost its mojo
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's been a difficult few years for
OL,7,FNike.
OL,9,FThe largest sportswear brand on the
OL,10,Fplanet, named after the ancient Greek
OL,11,Fgoddess of victory, has been losing of
OL,12,Flate. Losing sales, losing customers
OL,13,Fand losing ground to its rivals.
OL,15,FThe one-time industry disruptor is now
OL,16,Fthe establishment and in the middle of
OL,17,Fa tricky turnaround plan aimed at
OL,18,Fclinging on to market dominance.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
