OL,3,AWhat's gone wrong at Nike? How the
OL,4,Aworld's sportswear giant lost its mojo
OL,5,
OL,6,FNike's latest financial results show
OL,7,Fsigns a turnaround strategy put in
OL,8,Fplace by company veteran Elliott Hill,
OL,9,Fwho was coaxed out of retirement two
OL,10,Fyears ago to lead the firm, is working
OL,11,F- but the pace of change is more of a
OL,12,Fmarathon than sprint.
